hen standing at the bookshelf and facing the window, the lamp is to the left. The correct answer is D.\n</thinking>\n\n<answer>D</answer><|im_end|>","latent":{"blocks":2,"body_tokens":32,"events":[{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16}]},"prompt_sha256":"b0d1e417cc9387ed38ac58c41b2c24dc1b0864a77681a6f5986a404b920ce8ba","rl":null}
